    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# G1 - Automatic n8n workflow backup to GitHub\n\nSaves every workflow of your n8n instance as a JSON file in a GitHub repository.\nOnly workflows that changed create a new commit.\n\n**Setup (about 10 minutes)**\n1. Create a private GitHub repository for your backups\n2. Fill in the CONFIGURATION node (red notes = required)\n3. Connect 3 credentials: n8n API (read-only key), GitHub API, SMTP\n4. Run the workflow manually once and check your repository\n5. Activate the workflow to enable the daily schedule",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 592,
        "color": "#FFFF00"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -432,
        -336
      ],
      "id": "6003c07d-586c-424f-b0c4-93a538eaab02",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CONFIGURATION - required\nSet 3 values:\n- githubOwner: your GitHub username\n- githubRepo: the backup repository\n- backupFolder: folder inside the repository (default: workflows)",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 224,
        "color": "#FF0000"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        -64
      ],
      "id": "a776090a-4ef6-4f69-8a27-ad97742a8f63",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Triggers\nThe Schedule Trigger runs the backup automatically.\nThe Manual Trigger is for tests: click \"Execute workflow\".",
        "width": 224,
        "color": "#FFFF00"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -288,
        144
