    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read your workflows\nReads all workflows through the n8n API (credential: n8n API, read-only key).\nIf 0 workflows come back, the run stops with an error instead of silently doing nothing.",
        "height": 144,
        "width": 384,
        "color": "#FFFF00"
